{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>日本「防小人噴霧」出招財版！</h2>\n<p>日本淨化香氛品牌Oisesan繼早前爆紅的「防小人神器」淨化鹽噴霧後，再推出全新「金運」版本，主打提升財運與正能量。新品內含金箔成分，並以沉香、桂花與柑橘調製成溫暖香氣，一上市便在Threads引起熱烈討論。\n</p>\n<h2>內含金箔！</h2>\n<p>「金運淨化噴霧」瓶內加入金箔元素，令產品在視覺上更具招財氛圍。以天日鹽為基底，結合沉香木質精油，再配以甜美桂花與清新柑橘天然精油，營造溫暖而明亮的香氣層次。據產品資料介紹，想要提升財運時，只需輕輕一噴，負面情緒便會隨之消散，讓心情變得積極向上，從而吸引良緣與豐盛的福氣。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501763414496396_7818335786afdcba2916a3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501763414496396_7818335786afdcba2916a3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501763620959334_1830712636afdcba4ac578.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501763620959334_1830712636afdcba4ac578.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501763822960354_12506078776afdcba6901e9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501763822960354_12506078776afdcba6901e9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Df4qcDQE1WX/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T16:24:39.443259+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":356,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T16:00:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T16:57:54.188619+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T16:17:59.206029+00:00","content_hash":"789baf4f298e05b96ca767097a6e2b805419676bd71bcef3f15fdcedc01e445a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}